{"3831990":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Sujefa","steam_appid":3831990,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sujefa is a cooperative 2D puzzle-platformer made specifically for two players. Every level is designed around teamwork: communicating, coordinating, and using each character’s strengths and weaknesses to solve challenges together.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player chooses to play as Rock, Paper, or Scissors. Rock must avoid Paper, Paper must avoid Scissors, and Scissors must avoid Rock.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve 40 levels filled with platforming, cooperating and puzzle solving built around rock, paper and scissors.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play online with a friend or share a single screen locally.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sujefa is a cooperative 2D puzzle-platformer made specifically for two players. Every level is designed around teamwork: communicating, coordinating, and using each character’s strengths and weaknesses to solve challenges together.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player chooses to play as Rock, Paper, or Scissors. Rock must avoid Paper, Paper must avoid Scissors, and Scissors must avoid Rock.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve 40 levels filled with platforming, cooperating and puzzle solving built around rock, paper and scissors.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play online with a friend or share a single screen locally.<\/p>","short_description":"Sujefa is co-op puzzle platformer where two players can play as Rock, Paper or Scissors. Work together to solve puzzles and reach the end. Play online or locally on a shared screen.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3831990\/85433e51aefc79d8d4f3de2c091c733e938d5994\/header.jpg?t=1771610920","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/